Today, one of the biggest challenges in professional and commercial relationships is trust.

Clients often struggle to verify whether a freelancer or service provider will deliver what they promise. At the same time, service providers struggle to prove their work, establish clear expectations and secure fair outcomes. Too often, both sides rely on scattered reviews, references and informal agreements.

**This is the problem Deadline aims to solve.**

Deadline is a trust infrastructure platform designed to make professional reliability measurable, verifiable and portable.

Through a Deadline ID and a portable Trust Passport, we bring together verified identity, documented commitments, delivery evidence, two-sided reputation and optional payment protection through regulated partners.

Both parties agree on the scope and deadlines, milestones and evidence are recorded, and verified outcomes contribute to a professional track record that can travel across platforms.

Our vision is simple: to move professional relationships from promises and scattered reviews to structured commitments and evidence-backed trust.

**Deadline. Trust. Commit. Deliver.**

